{"id":"wu_ste","lemma":"Wüste","pos":"noun","rank":1975,"glosses":["desert","wilderness, waste, wasteland"],"ipa":"/ˈvyːstə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2e/De-W%C3%BCste.ogg/De-W%C3%BCste.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Wüste","plural":"Wüsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich hasse die Wüste.","en":"I hate the desert.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/388988","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate","l":"hassen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Wohnst du in der Wüste?","en":"Do you live in the desert?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761808","words":[{"g":"to live, reside, dwell","l":"wohnen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Er weiß, wie man in der Wüste Wasser findet.","en":"He knows how to find water in the desert.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"water"},{"g":"to find","l":"finden"}]},{"text":"Der Film wurde wirklich in einer Wüste gedreht.","en":"They shot the film in an actual desert.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"film"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"really, actually"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to turn","l":"drehen"}]},{"text":"Tom verirrte sich in der Wüste.","en":"Tom got lost in the desert.","words":[null,{"g":"to get lost","l":"verirren"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}